    ·                                     ────────┬────────
    ·                                             ╰── a bit field, not a place in memory
 99 │ }
    ╰────
  help: a field of a bit-field struct is a range of bits of its `u8`; copy it into a `let` and
        take that address, or take the address of the whole value (ADR 0059)
